，鄭執燕仲父而内惠王于周。二十七年，山戎來侵我，齊桓公救燕，遂北伐山戎而還。燕君送齊桓公出境，桓公因割燕所至地予燕，使燕共貢天子，如成周時職；使燕復修召公之法。三十三年卒，子襄公立。"}],"rationale":"依周初封建、燕君世系、割地救燕、讓國及秦滅諸國的具體語境暫定異稱。繼位不自動證父子；同爵者分國別與前後世代。太子平／燕昭王依本篇明示，不表示年代及世系已校定。作君奭為書名，君奭不説之君奭才暫解召公稱呼。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:p009","text":"莊公十二年，齊桓公始霸。十六年，與宋、衞共伐周惠王，惠王出奔温，立惠王弟穨爲周王。十七年，鄭執燕仲父而内惠王于周。二十七年，山戎來侵我，齊桓公救燕，遂北伐山戎而還。燕君送齊桓公出境，桓公因割燕所至地予燕，使燕共貢天子，如成周時職；使燕復修召公之法。三十三年卒，子襄公立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m009-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"莊公","kind":"person","person_id":"m8d_pnd_ias_AAAAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m009-0006","start":6,"end":9,"surface":"齊桓公","kind":"person","person_id":"9w2_c77_53m","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m009-0017","start":17,"end":18,"surface":"宋","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m009-0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"衞","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、匿名者、未定稱呼、書名或數位疑讀；不補姓名、性別與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m009-0022","start":22,"end":25,"surface":"周惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"yr6_rws_tx8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m009-0026","start":26,"end":28,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"yr6_rws_tx8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m009-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"yr6_rws_tx8","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m009-0036","start":36,"end":37,"surface":"穨","kind":"person","person_id":"gdy_039_7n5","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m009-0047","start":47,"end":50,"surface":"燕仲父","kind":"person","person_id":"wgh_mmm_fjq","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-034-yan:m009-0052","start":52,"end":54,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","per